    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "The baker’s delivery truck visits the caravan park every 4 days. The fishmonger visits every 5 days. If they both visit today, how many days will pass before they visit on the same day again?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "20 days.",
      "worked": "Non-zero multiples of $4$: $4,8,12,16,20,24,\\ldots$\n\nNon-zero multiples of $5$: $5,10,15,20,25,\\ldots$\n\nThe lowest common multiple of $4$ and $5$ is $20$, so they next visit on the same day after 20 days.",
